.el .ds Aq '
.TH devin-help-plugins 1  "plugins " 
.SH NAME
devin\-help\-plugins \- Manage plugins (install, list, info, update, remove)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdevin help plugins\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage plugins (install, list, info, update, remove)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-install(1)
Install a plugin from a source (auto\-installs its required plugins)
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-list(1)
List installed plugins with their version and blocked status
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-info(1)
Show a plugin\*(Aqs skills, hooks, rules, and its required/optional/forbidden lists
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-update(1)
Re\-fetch and re\-install a plugin (or all plugins) at the latest HEAD
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-remove(1)
Remove an installed plugin (auto\-installed requireds are left in place)
.TP
devin\-help\-plugins\-prune(1)
Prune plugin requirements from repos that no longer exist on disk, then garbage\-collect any plugin content no live scope still requires
